title: "eBLLM: verifier-gated conjecture closure (the VSI circuit, version 1.1)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bhattacharjee
    given-names: Deep
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0466-750X"
    email: d.bhattacharjee@erl-forschung.de
