version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-10
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/creelie/eBLLM"
keywords:
  - conjecture
  - formal verification
  - Lean 4
  - verifier-gated release
abstract: >-
  A Python package and a Lean 4 library implementing version 1.1 of the VSI circuit:
  typed conjecture packages, obligation graphs, a release algebra in which a result is
  released only when every verifier factor is 1, a context playbook with a corrected
  collapse guard, and Lean and command verifiers. A review of the paper's numbered results,
  with Lean-checked counterexamples, is included.
